    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/fc29082dfb9091d58a61dc90c9debe43.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paranormal Cleanup is a multiplayer horror game where up to 4 players take on the role of employees of a cleaning company tasked with cleaning up paranormal locations. You must work together to complete your mission, all while avoiding the relentless pursuit of the entities who try to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/e6075b88136da9a30624f7f2db696ebe.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The task is pretty simple - all you have to do is dispose(eat) moldy pizzas, unclog dirty toilets, scrub ectoplasm and clean up some trash here and there. But beware, entities like ghosts, cult leaders or other paranormal phenomena roam these places, and they're not happy about your presence. You'll need to be smart and stealthy as you clean up, as every action you take will increase the entities anger. Can you complete your cleaning missions, or will they hunt you down?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/7fc69c32376115fe7fac06cddd3f0736.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 Player Online Co-op Multiplayer</strong> <br>Survive together with your friends or struggle alone, if you have none  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong> <br>Nothing better than hearing your &quot;friends&quot; scream in the distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied Objectives</strong> - Clean paranormal locations by completing different tasks, like unclogging toilets, scrubbing ectoplasm and disposing (eating) moldy pizza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Unique Maps (3 more to come right after 1.0 Launch in May 2025!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrifying Enemies</strong> <br>Every map features its own unique supernatural threat, ranging from ghosts to cult leaders and other paranormal entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Banish</strong> - If you feel up to it, complete unique and hard objectives to weaken or even banish the entity hunting you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scaling Difficulty</strong><br>Every action you take will influence the entities behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression System</strong> - Earn EXP and $$$, unlock and upgrade perks and new gear, customize your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability</strong>  <br>Each Playthrough is different. All Item Locations and Entity Events are randomized.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive 3D Audio</strong> <br>Enjoy the spooky atmosphere while you hide in a closet<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/81d647851df6bf2c5cfb7e4d8475b303.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/fc29082dfb9091d58a61dc90c9debe43.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paranormal Cleanup is a multiplayer horror game where up to 4 players take on the role of employees of a cleaning company tasked with cleaning up paranormal locations. You must work together to complete your mission, all while avoiding the relentless pursuit of the entities who try to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/e6075b88136da9a30624f7f2db696ebe.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The task is pretty simple - all you have to do is dispose(eat) moldy pizzas, unclog dirty toilets, scrub ectoplasm and clean up some trash here and there. But beware, entities like ghosts, cult leaders or other paranormal phenomena roam these places, and they're not happy about your presence. You'll need to be smart and stealthy as you clean up, as every action you take will increase the entities anger. Can you complete your cleaning missions, or will they hunt you down?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/7fc69c32376115fe7fac06cddd3f0736.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 Player Online Co-op Multiplayer</strong> <br>Survive together with your friends or struggle alone, if you have none  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong> <br>Nothing better than hearing your &quot;friends&quot; scream in the distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied Objectives</strong> - Clean paranormal locations by completing different tasks, like unclogging toilets, scrubbing ectoplasm and disposing (eating) moldy pizza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Unique Maps (3 more to come right after 1.0 Launch in May 2025!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrifying Enemies</strong> <br>Every map features its own unique supernatural threat, ranging from ghosts to cult leaders and other paranormal entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Banish</strong> - If you feel up to it, complete unique and hard objectives to weaken or even banish the entity hunting you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scaling Difficulty</strong><br>Every action you take will influence the entities behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression System</strong> - Earn EXP and $$$, unlock and upgrade perks and new gear, customize your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability</strong>  <br>Each Playthrough is different. All Item Locations and Entity Events are randomized.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive 3D Audio</strong> <br>Enjoy the spooky atmosphere while you hide in a closet<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197890/extras/81d647851df6bf2c5cfb7e4d8475b303.avif?t=1748642528\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
    "short_description": "Paranormal Cleanup is a 1-4 player online co-op survival horror game. This is no ordinary clean-up job. You are tasked with cleaning up paranormal locations. Unclog dirty toilets and scrub ectoplasm, but don't get caught by the entities that are hunting you!",
